# Force source files to be diffed as text.
#
# Git decides binary-vs-text by sniffing for a NUL byte, and a single stray NUL
# turns a whole file opaque: `git diff` prints only "Bin N -> M bytes" with no
# content. lib/crypto.ts shipped that way, so a change to AES-GCM key
# derivation, the versioned blob format, and key rotation reached review with
# no visible diff on GitHub.
#
# scripts/preflight-commit.mjs now blocks a staged text file containing a NUL,
# which prevents a recurrence. This file covers the other half: a file that is
# already binary in history still diffs as text from here on, so a fix is
# reviewable rather than opaque in the very commit that repairs it.

*.ts    diff
*.tsx   diff
*.js    diff
*.jsx   diff
*.mjs   diff
*.cjs   diff
*.json  diff
*.md    diff
*.sql   diff
*.yml   diff
*.yaml  diff
*.css   diff
*.sh    diff
